  "title": "5 Essential Skills Every Family Caregiver Needs to Learn",
  "summary": "If you're caring for a parent or loved one at home, developing specific caregiving skills can make a significant difference in both safety and quality of care. These five foundational competencies keep your loved one safer, protect you from injury and burnout, and ensure you're providing the level of care they need. Whether you're exploring paid caregiving programs in Ohio or simply want to improve your caregiving approach, mastering these skills is essential.",
